==History==
2023
*The Barbarians's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 19/6/2023, in the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]].
*On 21/6/2023, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(21/6/2023)|maintenance break]], fixed the deploy sound effects of the Evolved Barbarians.
*On 24/8/2023, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (24/8/2023)|maintenence break]], decreased the Evolved Barbarians attack speed boost to 35% (from 50%).
*On 3/10/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/10/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Barbarians' hitpoints to 125% of the originals' (from 130%) and removed the Evolved Barbarians' damage boost.
*On 23/10/2023, the [[Version History#End of October 2023 Update (23/10/2023)|End of October 2023 Update]], fixed a bug where the [[Firecracker/Evolution|Evolved Firecracker]] would activate the Evolved Barbarians' rage with each attack.
2024
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Barbarians' attack speed boost duration to 3 seconds (from 2 seconds), and decreased the Evolved Barbarians' hitpoints to 110% of the originals' (from 125%).
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Barbarians after death.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], made it so that Evolved Barbarians' spawn formation would be correctly mirrored depending on which side of the [[Arenas|Arena]] they were placed.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] decreased the Rage's speed boost to 30% (from 35%).

